      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>Hello,</p><p>Thank you for your contribuition.</p><p>1- This post shouldn't be posted in STM32 MCU Products but rather in STM32CubeMx forum board. I move it then ..</p><p>2- I think the same issue raised in these threads:</p><p><a href=\"https://community.st.com/stm32cubemx-mcus-29/stm32cubemx-clock-validation-regression-stm32h743vihx-vos0-ldo-hclk-240-mhz-incorrectly-limited-to-225-mhz-166672?tid=166672&amp;fid=29\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">STM32CubeMX clock validation regression: STM32H743VIHx VOS0 LDO HCLK 240 MHz incorrectly limited to 225 MHz</a></p><p><a href=\"https://community.st.com/stm32cubemx-mcus-29/cubemx-version-6-18-0-introcudes-wrong-check-of-clock-limits-for-stm32h753-166599\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">CubeMX Version 6.18.0 introcudes wrong check of clock limits for STM32H753</a></p><p><a href=\"https://community.st.com/stm32cubemx-mcus-29/potential-bug-in-cubemx-6-18-0-clock-configuration-error-166657\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">Potential bug in CubeMX 6.18.0 – Clock Configuration error</a></p><p>The issue is already has been taken by the team over the internal ticket number: <em><strong>CDM0064049.</strong></em></p></div>"
